  "title": {
    "zh": "血液循环",
    "en": "Blood Circulation"
  },
  "desc": {
    "zh": "一滴血从左心室出发，先去全身再回心脏，再去肺里换气——两个环路接在同一颗心脏上，红和蓝只代表含氧量多少。",
    "en": "A drop of blood leaves the left ventricle, visits the whole body, returns to the heart, then goes to the lungs — two loops on one heart, with red and blue showing only oxygen content."
  },
